  "prefLabel": "Home 103.06 Seal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Home 103.06 Seal. The seal of the board shall be an embossed circular seal consisting of 2 concentric circles, the outer circle having a diameter of 1 7/8 inches and an inner circle having a diameter of 1 3/8 inches. In the space between the 2 circles at the top of the seal there shall be the words “Board of Home Inspectors.” At the bottom of the seal, in the space between the 2 circles, there shall be the words “State of New Hampshire.” In the center space there shall be a representation of the Old Man in the Mountain with a blue background.\n\nSource. #9503, eff 7-8-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/home100-600.html"
